ss=\\\"arrow-link\\\" href=\\\"/tools/\\\">See all free tools \\u2192</a></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"ft-cards\\\"><a class=\\\"ft-card\\\" href=\\\"/tools/training-zones-calculator/\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M3 3v18h18\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 15v3M11 11v7M15 8v10M19 5v13\\\"/></svg><span><b>Training zones</b><small>Power and heart-rate zones from your FTP</small></span><i aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\u2192</i></a><a class=\\\"ft-card\\\" href=\\\"/tools/ftp-test-calculator/\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"13\\\" r=\\\"8\\\"/><path d=\\\"M12 13l4-4M12 3V1M9 1h6\\\"/></svg><span><b>FTP test</b><small>Your FTP from a ramp, 8-min or 20-min test</small></span><i aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\u2192</i></a><a class=\\\"ft-card\\\" href=\\\"/tools/carbs-per-hour-calculator/\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 2v4M5 7l2.5 2.5M19 7l-2.5 2.5\\\"/><rect x=\\\"7\\\" y=\\\"9\\\" width=\\\"10\\\" height=\\\"13\\\" rx=\\\"3\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 14h10\\\"/></svg><span><b>Carbs per hour</b><small>Your fuelling plan in gels and bottles</small></span><i aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\u2192</i></a><a class=\\\"ft-card\\\" href=\\\"/tools/sweat-rate-calculator/\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 2.7l5.7 5.6a8 8 0 1 1-11.4 0z\\\"/></svg><span><b>Sweat rate</b><small>How much you sweat, and how much to drink</small></span><i aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\u2192</i></a><a class=\\\"ft-card\\\" href=\\\"/tools/critical-power-calculator/\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\\\"/></svg><span><b>Critical Power &amp; W\\u2032</b><small>CP, W\\u2032 and your best power from 2 to 20 min</small></span><i aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\u2192</i></a><a class=\\\"ft-card\\\" href=\\\"/tools/climb-time-calculator/\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20h20L14 6l-4 6-2-3-6 11z\\\"/><path d=\\\"M14 6l2 3\\\"/></svg><span><b>Climb time</b><small>Your time on the Stelvio, Alpe d\\u2019Huez or any climb</small></span><i aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\u2192</i></a><a class=\\\"ft-card\\\" href=\\\"/tools/gear-speed-calculator/\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"3\\\"/><path d=\\\"M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.2 4.2l2.8 2.8M17 17l2.8 2.8M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.2 19.8L7 17M17 7l2.8-2.8\\\"/></svg><span><b>Gear &amp; speed</b><small>Your speed in every gear at any cadence</small></span><i aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\u2192</i></a><a class=\\\"ft-card\\\" href=\\\"/tools/swim-pace-calculator/\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 18c2 0 2-1.5 4-1.5S8 18 10 18s2-1.5 4-1.5 2 1.5 4 1.5 2-1.5 4-1.5\\\"/><path d=\\\"M2 13c2 0 2-1.5 4-1.5S8 13 10 13s2-1.5 4-1.5 2 1.5 4 1.5 2-1.5 4-1.5\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"16\\\" cy=\\\"5\\\" r=\\\"2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M6 9l4-3 3 3\\\"/></svg><span><b>Swim pace (CSS)</b><small>Triathlon swim paces from two time trials</small></span><i aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\u2192</i></a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section></div>\"}, \"elements\": [], \"isInner\": false}, {\"id\": \"0eb9fee\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"widgetType\": \"html\", \"settings\": {\"html\": \"<script>(function(){var r=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;if(!r||matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)return;var hold=false,stop=false,vis=false;r.addEventListener('mouseenter',function(){hold=true;});r.addEventListener('mouseleave',function(){hold=false;});r.addEventListener('focusin',function(){hold=true;});r.addEventListener('focusout',function(){hold=false;});r.addEventListener('touchstart',function(){stop=true;},{passive:true});if('IntersectionObserver' in window)new IntersectionObserver(function(e){vis=e[0].isIntersecting;}).observe(r);setInterval(function(){if(stop||hold||!vis||document.hidden)return;var c=r.firstElementChild,w=c?c.getBoundingClientRect().width+14:300;if(r.scrollLeft>=r.scrollWidth-r.clientWidth-4)r.scrollTo({left:0,behavior:'smooth'});else r.scrollBy({left:w,behavior:'smooth'});},4000);})();</script>\"}, \"elements\": [], \"isInner\": false}], \"isInner\": false}]", "_elementor_edit_mode": "builder", "_elementor_template_type": "wp-page"}, "content": "<div class=\"cc cc-page\"><div class=\"hero hero-sm vi-hero\">\n  <img src=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-coaching-vision-hero-matteo.webp\" alt=\"Matteo Cigala in the Cigala Cycling kit looking over a mountain valley\" style=\"object-position:18% 40%\">\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"eyebrow eb-pill\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Our vision</div>\n    <h1>Train Smarter. Ride Faster.</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Structured, personalised coaching that makes every hour on the bike count.</p>\n    <div class=\"ctas\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"/individual-packages/\">View our coaching packages</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"https://calendly.com/cigalacycling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a free consultation</a></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"cc cc-page\"><section>\n  <div class=\"in split vi-q\">\n    <div class=\"gn-txt\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Train Smarter. Ride Faster.</div>\n      <h2>It's our vision</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div>\n      <blockquote class=\"bf-quote vi-quote\"><p>\u201cAt Cigala Cycling, we are here to help achieve your goals using the latest cutting-edge technology, science and support blended with my 28 years experience in the sport, between racing all my life and coaching for over a decade riders of all levels, from beginners to World Tour athletes\u201d</p><cite>Matteo Cigala \u2013 Founder &amp; Head Coach</cite></blockquote>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"vi-sig\"><img src=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-coaching-vision-matteo-signature.webp\" alt=\"Matteo Cigala, Founder &amp; Head Coach, in the white Cigala Cycling jersey, with his signature\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"720\" height=\"933\"></div>\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n<div class=\"cc cc-page\"><section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"gn-txt vi-why\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Why a coach</div>\n      <h3 class=\"h-sec\">WHY A CYCLING COACH?</h3><div class=\"bar\"></div>\n      <p>You know how to ride a bike, right? So why would you need a coach? Many people wouldn\u2019t consider playing tennis or golf without lessons, but because we grew up riding bikes, we assume we can do it all on our own. The truth is, cycling at any competitive level is complex. It\u2019s more than just riding fast \u2014 proper fitness, skills, and strategy are essential. You can spend a fortune on the lightest, most aerodynamic bike, but without the right training, it won\u2019t make you faster \u2014 though your bike will look amazing!</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n<div class=\"cc cc-page\"><section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">How we coach</div><h3 class=h-sec>OUR COACHING APPROACH</h3><div class=\"bar\"></div></div></div>\n    <ul class=\"sv-cards\"><li><svg class=\"sv-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/></svg><h3 class=\"h-sm\">Your goals first</h3><p>At Cigala Cycling, we start by understanding your goals, abilities, and limitations.</p></li><li><svg class=\"sv-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18\"/></svg><h3 class=\"h-sm\">A periodised annual plan</h3><p>From there, we build an annual training plan that is periodised and tailored with daily sessions designed specifically for you.</p></li><li><svg class=\"sv-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg><h3 class=\"h-sm\">Built around your life</h3><p>Your plan is created to maximise your time on the bike and fit around your schedule, goals, and lifestyle. Every plan is hand-crafted, completely customised, and built for your training availability \u2014 no two plans are alike, no copy-paste templates.</p></li><li><svg class=\"sv-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.4 8.4 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"/></svg><h3 class=\"h-sm\">A two-way process</h3><p>Coaching is a two-way process. With your ongoing feedback, we adjust your training load and schedule as needed to ensure continuous improvement.</p></li></ul>\n    <p class=\"vi-result\">The result? You train smarter, ride faster, and achieve your goals. That\u2019s our vision.</p>\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n<div class=\"cc cc-page\"><section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"vi-montage\"><img src=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-coaching-vision-over-a-decade.webp\" alt=\"Professional cycling montage | Cigala Cycling Coaching\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"></div>\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n<div class=\"cc cc-page\"><section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Good value</div><h2>Time on the bike maximised with structured training periodised to your goals.</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div></div></div>\n    <p class=\"vi-value\"><b>Good value. No matter what package you choose.</b> The packages start from only 19 euro/week. Yes, you read it right. Less than a coffee a day.</p>\n    <div class=\"sv-prices\"><div class=\"panel sv-price\"><div class=\"sv-pn\">Basic</div><div class=\"sv-pp\">\u20ac19<small>/week</small></div><div class=\"sv-ps\">12 weeks \u00b7 \u20ac228 one payment</div><p>A personalised plan you follow on your own.</p></div><div class=\"panel sv-price hot\"><div class=\"sv-pn\">Advanced</div><div class=\"sv-pp\">\u20ac149<small>/mo</small></div><div class=\"sv-ps\">6 months subscription</div><p>Our most popular: weekly feedback, analysis, a monthly call and Vekta.</p></div><div class=\"panel sv-price\"><div class=\"sv-pn\">Premium</div><div class=\"sv-pp\">\u20ac249<small>/mo</small></div><div class=\"sv-ps\">3 months subscription</div><p>The closest coaching: daily contact and feedback.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ctas sv-center\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"/individual-packages/\">View our coaching packages</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/tri-individual-packages/\">Triathlon packages</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section></div>\n<div class=\"cc cc-page\"><section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Real results</div><h2>READ OUR CASE STUDIES</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"rv-links\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"/case-studies/\">Read our case studies</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/testimonials/\">Read more testimonials</a></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cs-row\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Case studies, scroll sideways\"><a class=\"cs-card\" href=\"/case-studies/#marine-lenehan\"><span class=\"cs-img\"><img src=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-coaching-case-marine-lenehan.webp\" alt=\"Female cyclist biting gold medal | Cigala Cycling Coaching\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"object-position:45% 28%\"></span><span class=\"cs-tx\"><span class=\"cs-tag\">Road \u00b7 Gran Fondo &amp; gravel</span><b class=\"cs-stat\">WorldTour Pro</b><span class=\"cs-h\">From first ride to the WorldTour</span><span class=\"cs-n\">Marine Lenehan \u00b7 Ireland</span><span class=\"arrow-link\">Read the case study \u2192</span></span></a><a class=\"cs-card\" href=\"/case-studies/#tilen\"><span class=\"cs-img\"><img src=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-coaching-case-tilen.webp\" alt=\"Tilen \u010c. racing in a white team kit\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"object-position:50% 25%\"></span><span class=\"cs-tx\"><span class=\"cs-tag\">Road racing</span><b class=\"cs-stat\">1,063 W sprint</b><span class=\"cs-h\">From not sprinting out of the saddle to 1,063 W</span><span class=\"cs-n\">Tilen \u010c. \u00b7 Road racer \u00b7 Slovenia</span><span class=\"arrow-link\">Read the case study \u2192</span></span></a><a class=\"cs-card\" href=\"/case-studies/#marco\"><span class=\"cs-img\"><img src=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-coaching-case-marco.webp\" alt=\"Marco B. racing on gravel in a green kit, race number 96\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"object-position:50% 22%\"></span><span class=\"cs-tx\"><span class=\"cs-tag\">Road &amp; gravel</span><b class=\"cs-stat\">+124 W sprint</b><span class=\"cs-h\">Every number went up</span><span class=\"cs-n\">Marco B. \u00b7 Road &amp; gravel racer \u00b7 Portugal</span><span class=\"arrow-link\">Read the case study \u2192</span></span></a><a class=\"cs-card\" href=\"/case-studies/#eoin\"><span class=\"cs-img cs-data\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b>+104 W sprint</b><small>Best 15-second power</small></span><span class=\"cs-tx\"><span class=\"cs-tag\">Road racing</span><b class=\"cs-stat\">+104 W sprint</b><span class=\"cs-h\">All-time bests and category wins</span><span class=\"cs-n\">Eoin R. \u00b7 IVCA racer \u00b7 Ireland</span><span class=\"arrow-link\">Read the case study \u2192</span></span></a><a class=\"cs-card\" href=\"/case-studies/#vittorio\"><span class=\"cs-img\"><img src=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-coaching-case-vittorio.webp\" alt=\"Vittorio C. racing mountain bike in an orange helmet\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"object-position:35% 32%\"></span><span class=\"cs-tx\"><span class=\"cs-tag\">MTB &amp; cyclocross</span><b class=\"cs-stat\">1,112 W record</b><span class=\"cs-h\">Faster out of every corner</span><span class=\"cs-n\">Vittorio C. \u00b7 MTB &amp; cyclocross racer \u00b7 Italy</span><span class=\"arrow-link\">Read the case study \u2192</span></span></a><a class=\"cs-card\" href=\"/case-studies/#david\"><span class=\"cs-img\"><img src=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-coaching-case-david.webp\" alt=\"David O. racing in his Gorey CC club kit\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"object-position:45% 22%\"></span><span class=\"cs-tx\"><span class=\"cs-tag\">Sportive</span><b class=\"cs-stat\">+44 W CP</b><span class=\"cs-h\">+44 watts of engine</span><span class=\"cs-n\">David O. \u00b7 Sportive rider \u00b7 Ireland</span><span class=\"arrow-link\">Read the case study \u2192</span></span></a><a class=\"cs-card\" href=\"/case-studies/#shane-courtney\"><span class=\"cs-img\"><img src=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-coaching-case-shane-courtney.webp\" alt=\"Cyclist racing on road bike | Cigala Cycling Coaching\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"object-position:45% 50%\"></span><span class=\"cs-tx\"><span class=\"cs-tag\">Road racing</span><b class=\"cs-stat\">220 \u2192 260 W FTP</b><span class=\"cs-h\">+40 W FTP in under 4 months</span><span class=\"cs-n\">Shane Courtney \u00b7 Tralee Manor West ibike</span><span class=\"arrow-link\">Read the case study \u2192</span></span></a><a class=\"cs-card\" href=\"/case-studies/#bernd-ondruch\"><span class=\"cs-img\"><img src=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-coaching-case-bernd-ondruch-2x.webp\" alt=\"Cycling Pro wearing Kask helmet | Cigala Cycling Coaching\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"object-position:45% 40%\"></span><span class=\"cs-tx\"><span class=\"cs-tag\">Gran Fondo</span><b class=\"cs-stat\">Worlds qualified</b><span class=\"cs-h\">Qualified for the Gran Fondo Worlds</span><span class=\"cs-n\">Bernd Ondruch \u00b7 Germany</spa